invariant: INV-44
file: p384_wide_point.c
catches: p384_equiv_test
reason: the comparison never tries r + n, so a signature whose point
  has an x above n, where r is x - n, does not verify.
  bin/p384_equiv_test verifies one built on the point whose x is n +
  2.

--- old
    return x_is(sum, zz, r_plus_n);
--- new
    (void)r_plus_n;
    return 0;
